      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "\\(\\sqrt[\\frac{1}{6}]{ }\\) We have \\(2 x^{2} y^{2}=\\left(x^{2}+y^{2}\\right)^{2}-\\left(x^{4}+y^{4}\\right)=\\frac{1}{18}\\), so \\(x y=\\frac{1}{6}\\).",
